
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tarmoq kompyuteri</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;
 background:#070d1c;
 color:white;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
 overflow:hidden;
}
.slide{
 display:none;
 min-height:100vh;
 padding:65px 9%;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 flex-direction:column;
 background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,#183c69 0%,#0b1730 40%,#070d1c 80%);
 animation:show .5s;
}
.slide.active{display:flex}
@keyframes show{
 from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)}
 to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
}
.tag{
 color:#45d9ff;
 letter-spacing:4px;
 font-size:13px;
 font-weight:bold;
}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,75px);margin:20px 0}
h2{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,48px);color:#55d9ff}
p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.8;color:#c5d4e9}
.accent{color:#50d9ff}
.cardbox{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));
 gap:20px;
 width:100%;
 margin-top:30px;
}
.card{
 background:#142744;
 border:1px solid #28527a;
 padding:25px;
 border-radius:18px;
}
.card h3{color:#55d9ff;font-size:22px}
.card p{font-size:16px}
.icon{font-size:42px}
.network{
 display:flex;
 justify-content:center;
 align-items:center;
 gap:18px;
 flex-wrap:wrap;
 margin:30px;
}
.node{
 background:#123b65;
 border:2px solid #50d9ff;
 padding:20px;
 border-radius:15px;
 text-align:center;
}
.line{color:#50d9ff;font-size:28px}
.footer{
 position:fixed;
 bottom:20px;
 left:0;
 right:0;
 display:flex;
 justify-content:center;
 align-items:center;
 gap:20px;
}
button{
 background:#087fce;
 color:white;
 border:0;
 padding:12px 25px;
 border-radius:10px;
 font-size:16px;
 cursor:pointer;
}
button:hover{background:#15b8ed}
#count{color:#55d9ff}
@media(max-width:600px){
 .slide{padding:45px 7%}
 p{font-size:16px}
 .cardbox{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="slide active">
 <div class="tag">INFORMATIKA • TAQDIMOT</div>
 <h1>TARMOQ<br><span class="accent">KOMPYUTERI</span></h1>
 <p>Kompyuter tarmoqlari va ularning imkoniyatlari</p>
 <div class="network">
  <div class="node">💻<br>Kompyuter</div>
  <div class="line">⟷</div>
  <div class="node">🌐<br>Tarmoq</div>
  <div class="line">⟷</div>
  <div class="node">🖥️<br>Server</div>
 </div>
 <div class="tag">BILIM • TEXNOLOGIYA • KELAJAK</div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
 <div class="tag">01 — TUSHUNCHA</div>
 <h2>Kompyuter tarmog‘i nima?</h2>
 <p>Kompyuter tarmog‘i — ikki yoki undan ortiq kompyuter va boshqa qurilmalarning o‘zaro bog‘lanib, ma’lumot almashish tizimidir.</p>
 <div class="cardbox">
  <div class="card"><div class="icon">📡</div><h3>Aloqa</h3><p>Qurilmalar bir-biri bilan bog‘lanadi.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="icon">📁</div><h3>Ma’lumot</h3><p>Fayllar va axborotlar almashiladi.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="icon">🌍</div><h3>Internet</h3><p>Dunyo bo‘ylab axborot olish imkoniyati.</p></div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
 <div class="tag">02 — TURLARI</div>
 <h2>Tarmoq turlari</h2>
 <div class="cardbox">
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">🏠</div>
   <h3>LAN</h3>
   <p>Mahalliy tarmoq. Uy, maktab yoki ofisdagi qurilmalarni bog‘laydi.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">🏙️</div>
   <h3>MAN</h3>
   <p>Shahar miqyosidagi kompyuter tarmog‘i.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">🌐</div>
   <h3>WAN</h3>
   <p>Katta hududlarni, hatto davlatlarni bog‘laydigan tarmoq.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
 <div class="tag">03 — QURILMALAR</div>
 <h2>Tarmoqning asosiy qismlari</h2>
 <div class="cardbox">
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">🖥️</div>
   <h3>Kompyuter</h3>
   <p>Ma’lumotlarni yuboradi va qabul qiladi.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">📶</div>
   <h3>Router</h3>
   <p>Qurilmalarni tarmoqqa ulaydi va ma’lumot yo‘nalishini belgilaydi.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">🔌</div>
   <h3>Kabel</h3>
   <p>Qurilmalar orasida simli aloqa hosil qiladi.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
   <div class="icon">🗄️</div>
   <h3>Server</h3>
   <p>Tarmoqdagi boshqa qurilmalarga xizmat ko‘rsatadi.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
 <div class="tag">04 — XULOSA</div>
 <h2>Tarmoqning afzalliklari</h2>
 <div class="cardbox">
  <div class="card"><h3>⚡ Tezkorlik</h3><p>Ma’lumotlar tez almashiladi.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>🤝 Hamkorlik</h3><p>Bir nechta foydalanuvchi birgalikda ishlaydi.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>🔐 Xavfsizlik</h3><p>Ma’lumotlarni himoyalash imkoniyatlari mavjud.</p></div>
 </div>
 <h1 class="accent">E'TIBORINGIZ UCHUN RAHMAT!</h1>
 <p>Texnologiyalar — kelajak sari qadam!</p>
</section>

<div class="footer">
 <button onclick="change(-1)">← Orqaga</button>
 <span id="count">1 / 5</span>
 <button onclick="change(1)">Keyingi →</button>
</div>

<script>
let current=0;
const slides=document.querySelectorAll('.slide');
function change(step){
 current+=step;
 if(current<0)current=0;
 if(current>=slides.length)current=slides.length-1;
 slides.forEach((s,i)=>s.classList.toggle('active',i===current));
 document.getElementById('count').textContent=(current+1)+' / 5';
}
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{
 if(e.key==='ArrowRight')change(1);
 if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')change(-1);
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
